      "message": "Using base64 (without padding, i.e. with trailing \u0027\u003d\u0027 or \u0027\u003d\u003d\u0027), so has width is 256/6 \u003d 43 characters.\n\nThe width is always exactly 43 characters because every byte is treated as data:\n        var bytes \u003d []byte{0, 0, 0} // 24 bits\n\tfmt.Println(b.RawURLEncoding.EncodeToString(bytes)) // \"AAAA\" 24/6 \u003d 4 chars\n\nUsing URL version to avoid \u0027/\u0027 and \u0027+\u0027; choose \u0027-\u0027 and \u0027_\u0027 instead.\n\nfile size reduction 1.6MB (negligible given that the file size was 6.7GB)",
